  "content": "<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ds4cFyE.png\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns Banner\" width=\"1652\" height=\"812\"></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>附加灯笼</strong>添加了许多具有<strong>不同颜色和材质</strong>的全新灯笼！灯笼<strong>可以通过空手或红石信号来开启和关闭</strong>。</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AiaqFdz.png\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"56\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/PHjASBK.png\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns\" width=\"1424\" height=\"1568\"></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AiaqFdz.png\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"56\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>开启和关闭灯笼</strong></h4><h5>1. 直接右键点击灯笼即可</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/CCbMCcu.gif\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns turn on off demo\" width=\"503\" height=\"343\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>为灯笼染色</strong></h4><h5>1. 手持所需颜色的染料</h5><h5>2. 右键点击灯笼</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/4dIDXkW.gif\" alt=\"Additional Lantern coloring a lantern demo\" width=\"503\" height=\"343\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>用红石控制灯笼</strong></h4><h5>1. 使用红石信号为灯笼供能</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AiW4UXo.gif\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns redstone control demo\" width=\"503\" height=\"343\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AiaqFdz.png\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"56\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>常见问题</strong></h3><h4><strong>我可以在我的整合包中使用这个模组吗？</strong></h4><h5>可以，欢迎在整合包中随意使用本模组</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AiaqFdz.png\" alt=\"Additional Lanterns Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"56\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Discord社区</strong></h3><h5>欢迎加入SuperMartijn642的Discord服务器，获取最新内容、未来模组动态并参与讨论！</h5><h5><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" width=\"373\" height=\"102\"></a>